cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SOZLab: GUI and CLI for solvent occupancy zone analysis of molecular dynamics trajectories"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ferreira Francisco"
    given-names: "Aleff"
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
url: "https://github.com/aleff-ferreira/SOZLab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aleff-ferreira/SOZLab"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  SOZLab analyses the solvent in user-defined zones of molecular dynamics trajectories: occupancy,
  entries and exits, residence times with uncertainty, and solute-frame density maps, with
  provenance-verified frame extraction.
keywords:
  - solvent
  - occupancy
  - residence time
  - molecular dynamics
  - MDAnalysis
  - GROMACS
